// ==============================================================================
// HR ATTRITION RISK ANALYTICS - PRODUCTION DAX MEASURES SUITE
// Tool: Power BI Desktop / Analysis Services
// Target Fact Table: 'fact_employees'
// Best Practice: Organized into dedicated display folders
// ==============================================================================

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// FOLDER 1: CORE HEADCOUNT & ATTRITION METRICS
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Total Headcount = 
COUNTROWS('fact_employees')

Active Headcount = 
CALCULATE(
    COUNTROWS('fact_employees'),
    'fact_employees'[attrition] = "No"
)

Attrition Headcount = 
CALCULATE(
    COUNTROWS('fact_employees'),
    'fact_employees'[attrition] = "Yes"
)

Attrition Rate % = 
DIVIDE(
    [Attrition Headcount],
    [Total Headcount],
    0
)

Company Baseline Attrition Rate % = 
CALCULATE(
    [Attrition Rate %],
    ALL('fact_employees')
)

Attrition Rate Variance vs Benchmark % = 
[Attrition Rate %] - [Company Baseline Attrition Rate %]

Avg Monthly Compensation = 
AVERAGE('fact_employees'[monthly_income])

Avg Employee Tenure Years = 
AVERAGE('fact_employees'[years_at_company])


// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// FOLDER 2: MACHINE LEARNING & FLIGHT RISK PREDICTIVE METRICS
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Avg Attrition Probability % = 
AVERAGE('fact_employees'[attrition_probability])

High Risk Headcount = 
CALCULATE(
    COUNTROWS('fact_employees'),
    'fact_employees'[predicted_risk_tier] = "High Risk"
)

High Risk Proportion % = 
DIVIDE(
    [High Risk Headcount],
    [Total Headcount],
    0
)

Moderate Risk Headcount = 
CALCULATE(
    COUNTROWS('fact_employees'),
    'fact_employees'[predicted_risk_tier] = "Moderate Risk"
)

Low Risk Headcount = 
CALCULATE(
    COUNTROWS('fact_employees'),
    'fact_employees'[predicted_risk_tier] = "Low Risk"
)

Avg Flight Risk Score = 
AVERAGE('fact_employees'[flight_risk_score])

Department Risk Score = 
// Composite index: blends empirical attrition rate (40%) and predicted model risk (60%)
VAR _EmpiricalComponent = [Attrition Rate %] * 100 * 0.40
VAR _PredictiveComponent = [Avg Attrition Probability %] * 100 * 0.60
RETURN
ROUND(_EmpiricalComponent + _PredictiveComponent, 1)


// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// FOLDER 3: THE 3.4X OVERTIME & COMPENSATION COHORT METRICS
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

OverTime Headcount = 
CALCULATE(
    COUNTROWS('fact_employees'),
    'fact_employees'[overtime] = "Yes"
)

OverTime Saturation % = 
DIVIDE(
    [OverTime Headcount],
    [Total Headcount],
    0
)

Below Median Income Headcount = 
CALCULATE(
    COUNTROWS('fact_employees'),
    'fact_employees'[below_median_income_flag] = 1
)

Below Median Income Proportion % = 
DIVIDE(
    [Below Median Income Headcount],
    [Total Headcount],
    0
)

OT & Low Income Cohort Headcount = 
CALCULATE(
    COUNTROWS('fact_employees'),
    'fact_employees'[overtime_low_income_cohort] = 1
)

OT & Low Income Attrition Count = 
CALCULATE(
    COUNTROWS('fact_employees'),
    'fact_employees'[overtime_low_income_cohort] = 1,
    'fact_employees'[attrition] = "Yes"
)

OT & Low Income Attrition Rate % = 
DIVIDE(
    [OT & Low Income Attrition Count],
    [OT & Low Income Cohort Headcount],
    0
)

Standard Peer Baseline Attrition Rate % = 
// Baseline attrition rate for standard non-overtime peer benchmark cohort
CALCULATE(
    DIVIDE(
        CALCULATE(COUNTROWS('fact_employees'), 'fact_employees'[attrition] = "Yes"),
        COUNTROWS('fact_employees'),
        0
    ),
    'fact_employees'[overtime] = "No"
)

Cohort Risk Multiplier = 
// Dynamically surfaces the documented 3.4x / 4.1x risk disparity
DIVIDE(
    [OT & Low Income Attrition Rate %],
    [Standard Peer Baseline Attrition Rate %],
    0
)

Relative Risk vs Company Baseline = 
DIVIDE(
    [OT & Low Income Attrition Rate %],
    [Company Baseline Attrition Rate %],
    0
)


// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// FOLDER 4: FINANCIAL TURNOVER EXPOSURE & REPLACEMENT COST ($)
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Total Replacement Cost Exposure $ = 
SUM('fact_employees'[estimated_replacement_cost])

High Risk Replacement Exposure $ = 
CALCULATE(
    SUM('fact_employees'[estimated_replacement_cost]),
    'fact_employees'[predicted_risk_tier] = "High Risk"
)

Avg Replacement Cost per High Risk Employee $ = 
DIVIDE(
    [High Risk Replacement Exposure $],
    [High Risk Headcount],
    0
)

Department Financial Exposure Ranked = 
RANKX(
    ALL('dim_department'[department_name]),
    [High Risk Replacement Exposure $],
    ,
    DESC,
    Dense
)


// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// FOLDER 5: WHAT-IF ATTRITION & RETENTION SIMULATION
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

WhatIf OverTime Reduction Pct = 
// Connects to a What-If parameter slicer (0% to 50% in steps of 5%)
SELECTEDVALUE('WhatIf_OverTime_Parameter'[OverTime Reduction], 0.20)

WhatIf Salary Correction Pct = 
// Connects to a What-If parameter slicer (0% to 30% in steps of 5%)
SELECTEDVALUE('WhatIf_Salary_Parameter'[Salary Increase], 0.10)

Simulated Attrition Prevention Headcount = 
// Evaluates how many departures can be averted by curbing overtime in the high-risk cohort
VAR _CohortAtRisk = [OT & Low Income Attrition Count]
VAR _Efficacy = [WhatIf OverTime Reduction Pct] * 0.70 + [WhatIf Salary Correction Pct] * 0.30
RETURN
ROUND(_CohortAtRisk * _Efficacy, 0)

Simulated Cost Savings ROI $ = 
// Financial savings achieved by avoiding recruitment and replacement costs
VAR _SavedHeadcount = [Simulated Attrition Prevention Headcount]
VAR _AvgReplacementCost = 80000 // Average baseline replacement cost across vulnerable tiers
RETURN
_SavedHeadcount * _AvgReplacementCost
